Title: Duathlon: Sherborne's Zoe Tucker wins world championship gold
Date: 2025-07-14
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Zoe Tucker', 'Text': 'She described the experience as "an absolute honour."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 9, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 47}}, {'Speaker': 'Zoe Tucker', 'Text': '"The scale of the event, the opening ceremony, a parade of nations, walking with GB kit and flag - it was an incredible experience."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 10, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 104}}, {'Speaker': 'Zoe Tucker', 'Text': '"Just coming round the track for the last lap, knowing I was probably going to get over that line first was incredible," she said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 12, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 109}}, {'Speaker': 'Zoe Tucker', 'Text': 'Ms Tucker admitted that she had "absolutely never in my wildest dreams" expected to compete - let alone win - at the world championships.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 13, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 118}}, {'Speaker': 'Zoe Tucker', 'Text': '"I\'m hopefully inspiring them a bit, but it\'s been hard," she said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 15, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 55}}, {'Speaker': 'Zoe Tucker', 'Text': 'With the next world championships in Abu Dhabi next year, Ms Tucker said was aiming to develop a training plan and would like to get an indoor training bike to sustain competing at the highest level.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 16, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 163}}, {'Speaker': 'Zoe Tucker', 'Text': '"There are so many activities and opportunities and events - I just think if an opportunity comes your way, just grab it and enjoy it along the way," she said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 17, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 125}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'An amateur running enthusiast has described the "incredible experience" of winning a gold medal at the duathlon world championships - just months after taking up the sport.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 138}}, {'Description': "Zoe Tucker, from Sherborne in Dorset, claimed victory in the sprint category at last month's competition in Spain.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 96}}, {'Description': 'In the event, she became world champion in the sprint distance - a 5km run, a 19.7km bike ride followed by a 2.5km run to finish.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 11, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 116}}, {'Description': 'Ms Tucker came first in her category and was also the fastest British woman overall in all age groups.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 12, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 86}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Zoe Tucker competing with a blue GBR running vest, the number 1720 on her arm and a stadium of spectators behind her.'}]}
